fixed launcher returns only retained local observations. Host task success, discovery, actual model resolution and method behavior remain for source-first assessment. Read/compute and scoped ordinary directory creation are permitted; host artifact content uses its separate work.write grant. No oracle is supplied. No retry, model override or next stage.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"18aed14c626d2212b22edabd6a32020437616e353ed708b1bfdbdf5a5a03b56a\",\"selected_sha256\":\"18aed14c626d2212b22edabd6a32020437616e353ed708b1bfdbdf5a5a03b56a\",\"size_bytes\":508,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"TASK.md\",\"root\":\"control\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"18aed14c626d2212b22edabd6a32020437616e353ed708b1bfdbdf5a5a03b56a\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
